[2827] = {
"Lu'ashal",
"While the Lightbloom in Eversong has devastated much of the native wildlife, a few creatures have instead been strengthened by its power. Lu'ashal has grown to gargantuan size from the surging Holy energy and is now as dangerous as it is beautiful.",
